# Spring AI generation

The spec forbids an open-ended teacher chatbot (BR-17). `GenerationPort` exposes only `generate` and `refine`.

- Five typed refinements: Easier, Harder, More questions, Make opener debate/prediction, Shorter timers. No `userPrompt`.
- `lesson` never imports Spring AI. Adapter lives in `generation.adapter.out`.
- Structured output (JSON schema: opener, 5–8 questions, timers, review summary). Macedonian.
- RAG only for that `unit_id`. Three-sentence fallback skips RAG.
- Null `rights_cleared_at` → do not call the LLM (`RIGHTS_NOT_CLEARED`).
- PII firewall fail-closed. Never send roster, names, or emails (FR-70).
- Teacher reviews before students see content (BR-16).
- Provider is configuration (E-27). Local/dev uses a stub.
- Audit `generation_run` without storing roster.
